# 只声明二进制类型，防止任何平台/工具对二进制做换行转换（AUD-25）。
# 故意不对文本文件加 eol 规则：存量含 12 个 CRLF 与校验和清单，换行归一
# 会改动既有证据的字节与哈希；新文本文件的换行由 .editorconfig 约束。
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.mp4 binary
*.zip binary
*.zip.* binary
*.npz binary
*.keras binary
*.pth binary
*.pt binary
*.psd binary
*.pdf binary
*.docx binary
*.pptx binary
*.xlsx binary
*.ttf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
